 "sentences": [
  "This bird has a bright blue beak.",
  "The black-and-yellow broadbill is a small, distinctive species.",
  "Males and females look slightly different, with females having an incomplete black breastband.",
  "They live across Southeast Asia in forests and plantations.",
  "These birds mostly eat insects, but they also snack on molluscs and fruit.",
  "Both parents work together to build a messy, pear-shaped nest from moss and leaves."
